refactor(roles): consolidate 26→22 roles per founder diagram review

Founder reviewed the role catalog against his hand-drawn diagram and
merged four redundant roles into their nearest survivor:

  site_supervisor + civil_engineer → site_engineer   (one field role)
  project_head                     → pm               (one PM role)
  interior_designer                → design_architect_interior

Kept: promoter (digest buyer), designer (design projects).

Code:
- roles.ts: IDENTITY_ROLES 26→22, PROJECT_TIER_ROLES 22→18,
  ROLE_CATEGORY/ROLE_LABEL/VALID_PROJECT_ROLES_BY_TYPE/defaults updated.
- permissions-matrix.ts: site_engineer gains voice:record; pm gains
  rabill:approve + export:csv (no capability lost in the merges); the 4
  role entries removed from identity + project tiers.
- dashboards: dashboardForRole maps site_engineer → "field" (was
  site_supervisor → "site-supervisor"); SiteSupervisorDashboard now
  renders for site_engineer with a Site Engineer badge.
- role-meta.ts: 4 colour entries removed.

Data:
- migration 68: dedupe-safe data migration (handles project_members PK
  collisions + the two-sources-to-site_engineer case) THEN tightens
  profiles_role_check (22) + project_members_role_check (18) + rebuilds
  the role_catalog view. Idempotent. NOT yet applied to live DB.

Tests + scripts + docs:
- catalogParity now reads migration 68; roles/roleDiagram/permsMatrix/
  roleMeta/dashboard/navConfig/fetchAuthSession/projectQueries/tabsConfig
  tests updated to the consolidated catalog.
- create-test-users.mjs: site_supervisor → site_engineer test user.
- ROLE_DIAGRAM_RECONCILIATION.md + V3_LIVE_DEMO_PATH.md updated.

Legacy (strangler-fig) untouched: permissions.js, projectTypes.js,
ui.jsx, seed.demo.js, detail/org feature files still reference old role
names — they fall back gracefully and no longer receive those roles.

Validation: 1024 tests green, tsc clean, 0 lint errors, smoke 324, build OK.

